{"title":"2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Samantha receives the following marks out of 100 in seven of her eight courses:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine her average mark in these seven courses.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the marks of her courses is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cf8a764b0147dc1cde725d205e54b92645a7d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$94 + 93 + 84 + 81 + 74 + 83 + 79 = 187 + 165 + 157 + 79 = 352 + 236 = 588$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"606\" height=\"15\" />. There were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> courses, so the average of her marks is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc5e7f3f05f7cf87138b1f3a3473af008b35ce10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{588}{7} = \\boxed{84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/08768a70787b815dd14316cbc7ebb4c2ca1d2467.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$94 = 84 + 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/e/1ee605f65f6387f888083245d2b86740386c969d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$93 = 84 + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/a/69ad9541a38a3e7031b08d264b3018328eff8c85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81 = 84 - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/b/afbd3691a115dbfcc685b9c9ccdf677c050dc338.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74 = 84 - 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/e/99e2c38c2aa6905d6b6bece98d21f2d5bbd1759c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$79 = 84 - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, all the numbers would sum up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c582b067d920d8dede3bdb0b76c95ee73271344.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$84 \\times 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, so the average of her marks is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad677c36392482365f9178b10331bfb81b74a3ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"31\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211530\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 55/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 843/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1882/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.081      1 2006_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%   12.081      1 -total\n 42.65%    5.153      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36621:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017211530 and revision id 282472. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}